{"c":{"89464":["Mumei","Female","b89464-3QoSJw8XzDkH.jpg","A mysterious, arrogant and playful yet exceedingly strong and brave girl who arrives at Aragane Station with unclear intent.",1163],"89465":["Ayame Yomogawa","Female","b89465-tUQaGxpPCrKz.jpg","Ayame is the eldest daughter and heir of the Yomogawa family that governs Aragane Station. She is the user of the master key.",95],"89466":["Kurusu","Male","b89466-e3jSPDKHRIoL.png","A young warrior who serves Ayame's family as her personal bodyguard. Among warriors his sword arm is considerable. Is usually sober and honest, and he maintains his honor as a warrior.",82],"89467":["Takumi","Male","b89467-AXQ0GCcTiI5z.png","Ikoma's friend and fellow steam smith. Though he's shocked by Ikoma's rashness, he admires how Ikoma isn't afraid of anyone.",43],"89468":["Kajika","Female","b89468-JUOLxuQZgZ4G.jpg","Ikoma and Takumi's friend and fellow steam smith. She has a familial personality.",54],"89469":["Yukina","Female","b89469-lqZkuy6Gnnwl.jpg","A crew member of the Hayajiro \"Koutetsujou\". Although calm and reserved, she's very trustworthy, rational and caring, and doesn't hesitate to stand up for herself when necessary.",216],"89470":["Sukari","Male","b89470-64nBItEMtj2J.png","A steam smith who lives at Aragane Station. He puts up a cynical front, but has good judgement.",41],"89471":["Kibito","Male","b89471-quAzgchiYSlx.png","A warrior who serves Ayame's family. He is understanding and treats people of all social classes without discrimination.",13],"89472":["Ikoma","Male","b89472-Ayu4lT9Crbl5.png","A headstrong and passionate young Steam Smith and inventor from Hinomoto who makes a living in Aragane Station making iron and steam engines. He and his good friend Takumi developed a weapon called \"Tsuranuki Zutsu\" in order to defeat the Kabane.",397],"89473":["Biba Amatori","Male","89473-F44bmJ7oNvOx.jpg","Biba also known as the Liberator, is the leader of the Hunters and the eldest son of the Shogun.",25],"143177":["Uryuu",null,"b143177-MCshktr7TX0c.jpg","A member of the Kabane Hunters.",18],"238791":["Hatsune","Female","b238791-4Xzr1TyrUltD.png","The younger sister of Ikoma. Originally she lived peacefully alongside her brother in a station, however she was later killed in the past during a Kabane attack, Hatsune's death motivated Ikoma's desire to exterminate the Kabane from existence.",8],"244004":["Suzuki",null,"b244004-VpRXnsmWC29r.png","The train's chief mechanic, who's hair is styled like a 17th century wig and speaks with english phrases. Also served as narrator for each episodes' preview.",21],"260400":["Mumei's Mother","Female","b260400-OXoBFlCRb9cU.png","",0],"260402":["Shoujin","Male","b260402-5ffhMOHc4g6K.png","",0],"260404":["Nisuke","Male","b260404-Ik98LRZbXPd4.png","",1],"260405":["Akouji","Male","b260405-j7PBRaakqIIM.png","",0],"260408":["Shuzo","Male","b260408-3XA1GV9g06Qp.png","",0],"260409":["Tsukamaki","Male","b260409-QKQoLFWZvvF4.png","",0],"260412":["Gakaku","Male","b260412-TsaXIYVZhxvQ.png","",1],"260415":["Kotarou","Male","b260415-Tq3fSA6fVmjU.png","",0],"260416":["Hattori","Male","b260416-Ay40AXGD4dKB.png","",0],"260418":["Bokka","Male","b260418-pyuPVQH70NwM.png","",0],"260419":["Yahagi","Male","b260419-6pn2AO8bGMaY.png","",0],"260420":["Sayo","Female","b260420-POJKERZLa0g1.png","",1],"406011":["Kenshou Yomogawa","Male","b406011-iq4zclyPYrDr.png","Kenshou Yomogawa was the lord of Aragane Station and the father of Ayame Yomogawa.",0],"406012":["Shimon","Male","b406012-OX3yQnrDLKok.png","",0],"406013":["Watanuki","Male","b406013-OxAoLrg7Siba.png","",0],"406014":["Banki","Male","b406014-28dKFZw0H4bd.png","",0],"406015":["Momoya","Male","b406015-1oBud8VtBRhE.png","",0],"406016":["Ichinoshin","Male","b406016-2NA6PKZzJq2L.png","",0],"406019":["Shino","Female","b406019-hVbJo0XT1k0H.png","",0],"406020":["Saba",null,"default.jpg","",0],"406021":["Roujin",null,"default.jpg","",0],"406022":["Tenyuu Oshou",null,"default.jpg","",0],"406023":["Houki",null,"default.jpg"